{
  "about": "Every field, action, API call, default, locked state and visible message of the admin portal before the v3 redesign, read from services/static/public/*.html at commit 2db1248. test_ui_guards.py fails when the new UI loses one. Each item either lists 'expect' (literal snippets that must all appear in the new HTML/JS) or 'dropped' (why it was removed on purpose). A word snippet that the new UI shows through the catalog lists, under 'catalog', the catalog keys that held it when the words were last read from the catalog; the guard follows those keys, so the writer can reword them.",
  "source_commit": "2db1248",
